{"actor":"agent:orchestrator","data":{"body":"Merged as PR #15 (squash). Verified: uploads.direct.ts is now uploads.routes.ts and inside the glob; check:api sees 5 upload/media paths across 8 operations; MRQ-14's AC-231 guardrail tests survive intact (4 occurrences, unchanged) \u2014 the port did not weaken a test to pass. Scope discharged correctly. FOLLOW-UP RAISED AS MRQ-61: while verifying this I found auth.endpoints.ts and admin-ops.endpoints.ts are raw Hono sub-apps mounted directly in src/index.ts, so /api/v1/auth/* and /api/v1/admin/* are absent from the manifest and OpenAPI \u2014 the same armed check:api failure this ticket just fixed for uploads, and worse because walkthrough step 1 is a demo login POST.","role":"review"},"id":"ev_01KZQ9AEJXJ703Y7W44RN9XTCJ","schema_version":1,"task_id":"task_01KZQ68TD08YK1BF1XTH374GP2","ts":"2026-08-11T02:09:45Z","type":"comment_added"}
